** Simple Power Transmission with Transformers
Rs gen N001 {Rgen}
Rl N001 N003 {Rline}
Ll N003 out1 {Lline}
Vs gen 0 SIN(0 120 60)
Rh out1 0 {Rload}
Rg gen N002 {Rgen}
Rt sender N004 {Rline}
Lt N004 receiver {Lline}
L1 N002 0 {Llow}
L2 sender 0 {Lhigh}
L3 receiver 0 {Lhigh}
L4 out2 0 {Llow}
Ro out2 0 {Rload}
K1 L1 L2 1
K2 L3 L4 1
.param Rgen=50
.param Rline=2
.param Lline=7
.param Rload=1k
.param Llow=10
.param Lhigh=2.5k
.tran 0 200m
.end
